    # DAVIK "It was supposed to contain all her nightmares and set her free, but..."
    DAVIK "すべての悪夢を閉じ込めて彼女を解放するはずだった、だが…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:732
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l2_start_b6aaa31d:

    # DAVIK "The house hungers, it's taking a life of its own."
    DAVIK "家が飢えている。独自の命を持ち始めているんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:733
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l2_start_9cce26fd:

    # MC @ surprised "{i}This house... came from her dreams?{/i}"
    MC @ surprised "{i}この家が…彼女の夢から？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:734
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l2_start_e4e07003:

    # DAVIK "Yes..."
    DAVIK "ああ…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:737
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l2_start_menu_f48bc021:

