    # "It's something new now."
    "今度は新しいものだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1961
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_16a11c2d:

    # "Not the same old faces who would visit me every night."
    "毎晩訪ねてきた同じ古い顔ぶれではない。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1962
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_ee6d7d9a:

    # "This one speaks to me."
    "これは私に話しかけてくる。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1963
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_303a4556:

    # "It says it wants to be free."
    "自由になりたいと言っている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1964
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_fa9c241b:

    # "That my mind is a prison."
    "私の心は牢獄だと。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1965
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_2b614b72:

    # "... It... It's just another nightmare."
    "…それは…ただの別の悪夢だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1966
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_9979a58c:

    # "Right?"
    "そうでしょ？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1970
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_2938cfcc:

    # "{i}He said no.{/i}"
    "{i}彼はノーと言った。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1972
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_dbff601d:

    # MC @ surprised "FUCK!"
    MC @ surprised "クソ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1975
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_8210fe36:

    # "Mother has just told me her friend, the lady with the cat tail, is now also my mommy."
    "母はちょうど、猫のしっぽを持った友達が今は私のママでもあると言った。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1976
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_be1e4a83:

    # "She seems nice, but maybe a little strict."
    "彼女は優しそうだけど、少し厳しいかも。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1977
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_103805ec:

    # "... But I don't think I need another mother."
    "…でももう一人の母親は必要ないと思う。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1978
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_cda5af69:

    # "I just really miss father."
    "ただ本当に父親が恋しい。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1981
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_f05f2d15:

    # "I see father less and less."
    "父親に会うことがどんどん少なくなっている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1982
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_99c2275b:

    # "It's been months now."
    "もう何ヶ月もだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1983
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_e03bcff2:

    # "... Maybe he's just never coming back?"
    "…もしかしたら彼はもう二度と戻ってこないのかも？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1984
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_382f2858:

    # "Mother is talking about us leaving and heading to live in a place far away."
    "母は私たちが去って遠くの場所に住むことについて話している。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1985
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_a0bb76e0:

    # "If that happens, will father still visit?"
    "もしそうなったら、父親はまだ訪ねてくる？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1986
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_1_menu_11402407:

    # "{i}... Does he still love me?{/i}"
    "{i}…彼はまだ私を愛しているの？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1997
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_99cef191:

    # "A man tried to kidnap me tonight. Thankfully, our guards managed to stop him."
    "今夜、男が私を誘拐しようとした。ありがたいことに、衛兵たちが彼を止めることができた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1998
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_5db348b5:

    # "My mothers are terrified, but..."
    "母親たちは怯えている、でも…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1999
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_514db6e3:

    # "I'm more frightened about what I might dream happens tonight."
    "今夜どんな夢を見てしまうか、そっちの方がもっと怖い。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2000
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_ca0a8285:

    # "... Between the pages, a green skull key fell out."
    "…ページの間から、緑の髑髏の鍵が落ちた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2004
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_5ac5c20e:

    # "I wish I had more actual friends."
    "もっと本当の友達がいればいいのに。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2005
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_a1157de1:

    # "I mean, the people at the academy are fine,"
    "つまり、学院の人たちはいい人たちだけど、"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2006
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_e5f52d0d:

    # "but it's all cliques and coin and..."
    "でも全部が派閥とお金と…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2007
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_fa990cff:

    # "No one is friends with anyone, really. It's all just strategic alignments."
    "誰も本当の友達じゃない。全部がただの戦略的な繋がり。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2008
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_9b223944:

    # "... Fuck, I just wish someone was real for once."
    "…クソ、一度でいいから誰かが本物であってほしい。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2011
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_d47f9121:

    # "Father returned with a strange man."
    "父が奇妙な男と一緒に戻ってきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2012
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_c3456a70:

    # "He said the two of them were going to help me get rid of the nightmares once and for all."
    "彼は二人で私の悪夢を完全に取り除く手伝いをすると言った。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2013
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_4ef80800:

    # "Father... You still remembered me!"
    "お父さん…まだ私を覚えていてくれたんだ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2016
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_b537a0dd:

    # "I had a strange dream tonight. A man, handsome with black hair."
    "今夜奇妙な夢を見た。黒い髪のハンサムな男。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2017
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_d64178bc:

    # "But he wasn't fully human. Inside of him... there was another soul."
    "でも彼は完全な人間ではなかった。彼の中には…もう一つの魂があった。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2018
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_1b253a90:

    # "He swore he would save me, but it's so strange..."
    "彼は私を救うと誓った、でもとても奇妙だ…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2019
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_bookshelf_2_menu_7b0b2236:

    # "I've never even seen this man before in my life?"
    "人生でこの男を見たことすらないのに？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2027
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l4_library_portrait_20de2b90:

    # "... Hmm."
    "…ふむ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2044
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_start_352f5d88:

    # "As we pushed on once more through the bright light, we found ourselves again in the entrance hallway of the house,"
    "明るい光の中をもう一度進むと、再び家の玄関ホールにいることに気づいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2045
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_start_5122da77:

    # "only to face a brand new horror..."
    "ただ、まったく新しい恐怖に直面するために…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2046
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_start_b10dd20e:

    # MARKUS @ scared "The house is flooded!"
    MARKUS @ scared "家が水浸しだ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2047
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_start_486c0433:

    # SYPHA @ angry "Urgh... This better not ruin my clothes!"
    SYPHA @ angry "うぅ…これで服が台無しにならないでよ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2049
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_start_062c2bf8:

    # VES @ talk "How much more of this damn house is there?!"
    VES @ talk "このクソ家はあとどれだけあるんだ？！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2050
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_start_17f2980a:

    # KIARA @ sad "Brrr! This water's so cold!"
    KIARA @ sad "ブルル！この水、すごく冷たい！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2051
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_start_7f9a289d:

    # KIARA @ sad "I can't see a damn thing beneath it!"
    KIARA @ sad "下に何も見えない！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2052
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_start_65d8894b:

    # "Hearing something splash, I quickly turned my attention toward it."
    "何かが水しぶきを上げるのを聞いて、素早くそちらに注意を向けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2053
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_start_90d542c5:

    # MC @ serious "What was that?"
    MC @ serious "今のは何だ？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2054
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_start_65e22635:

    # SYPHA @ talk "I don't know, but the last thing we should do is wait around and find out..."
    SYPHA @ talk "分からないけど、じっとして確かめるのが一番避けるべきことよ…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2061
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_bathtub_f1bb8145:

    # "It's completely rotten away and covered in mold."
    "完全に腐り果ててカビに覆われている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2065
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_mirror_46c2824e:

    # "It's caked in so much dirt, I can't see anything reflected."
    "あまりにも汚れで固まっていて、何も映らない。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2071
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_upstairs_to_hallway2_13142b1a:

    # MC "(Locked...)"
    MC "（鍵がかかっている…）"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2076
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_upstairs_to_hallway2_5b5c4c81:

    # MC "(That does it.)"
    MC "（効いた。）"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2085
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_toys_c3af8770:

    # "The toys are completely ruined by the damp..."
    "おもちゃは湿気で完全に台無しだ…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2090
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_crib_d13de5d6:

    # "The crib is damp and covered in mold. The wood is completely rotten."
    "揺りかごは湿っていてカビに覆われている。木材は完全に腐っている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2091
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_crib_291f0001:

    # "There is a key inside."
    "中に鍵がある。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2097
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_bedroom_door_aeb91391:

    # MC "(It's locked.)"
    MC "（鍵がかかっている。）"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2098
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_bedroom_door_0560ff66:

    # MC "(I need a key...)"
    MC "（鍵が必要だ…）"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2103
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_bedroom_door_827f0e2a:

    # MC "(There...)"
    MC "（そこだ…）"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2112
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_candle_9e5e67e3:

    # MC @ think "(A purple flame now...)"
    MC @ think "（今度は紫の炎…）"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2119
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_table_a88f00bd:

    # "(The table is completely rotten and overrun with mold and vines.)"
    "（テーブルは完全に腐り、カビと蔓に覆われている。）"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2123
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_head_531289b1:

    # "(The mounted head of a lizard, eroded and filthy.)"
    "（剥製にされたトカゲの頭、浸食されて汚れている。）"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2127
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_portrait_b6db3355:

    # "A portrait of a derelict house in swamp land."
    "沼地の荒廃した家の肖像画。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2135
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_kitchen_cupboards_397be328:

    # "Completely empty and rotten."
    "完全に空っぽで腐っている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2139
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_kitchen_pot_18209317:

    # MC "(The fire is out. There's nothing in the pot other than black, pungent water.)"
    MC "（火は消えている。鍋には黒く刺激臭のする水以外何もない。）"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2145
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_kitchen_to_cellar_13142b1a:

    # MC "(Locked...)"
    MC "（鍵がかかっている…）"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2150
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_kitchen_to_cellar_5b5c4c81:

    # MC "(That does it.)"
    MC "（効いた。）"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2157
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_cellar_barrel_535a074c:

    # "There's nothing left..."
    "何も残っていない…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2162
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_cellar_paper_7a9d7dbc:

    # "There... carefully placed in the center of the desk, a purple skull key."
    "そこに…机の中央に慎重に置かれた、紫の髑髏の鍵。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2171
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_library_fireplace_699ae0c6:

    # "The fire is out and completely soaked."
    "火は消えて完全にびしょ濡れだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2172
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_library_fireplace_70a8c622:

    # "There though, hidden beneath a wet, rotten log, is a key with a lizard-shaped head."
    "だがそこに、濡れて腐った丸太の下に隠された、トカゲの形の頭を持つ鍵がある。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2178
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_library_bookshelf_1_187f9b50:

    # "The books are all soaking wet and destroyed."
    "本はすべてずぶ濡れで破壊されている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2183
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_library_bookshelf_2_be2c8e3d:

    # "The pages are completely illegible."
    "ページは完全に読めない。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2184
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_library_bookshelf_2_bacadf70:

    # "A book literally rots away in my hand as I try to pick it up."
    "手に取ろうとすると、本が文字通り手の中で腐り落ちる。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2189
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_l5_library_portrait_2280a906:

    # "... Creepy."
    "…不気味。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2225
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_88a79f84:

    # "This time, as we pushed through the doorway, we found ourselves, for the first time, not looping back to the entrance hallway,"
    "今度は、出入り口を通り抜けると、初めて玄関ホールにループバックせず、"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2226
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_8a10ab7f:

    # "but within the master bedroom itself at last... Or at least,"
    "ついにマスターベッドルーム自体の中にいることに気づいた…少なくとも、"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2227
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_7a3da93b:

    # "what I thought was supposed to be the master bedroom."
    "マスターベッドルームのはずだと思っていた場所に。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2228
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_bdc04444:

    # "Looking behind me, I could see everyone was back—dazed and confused, perhaps—but... alive and present."
    "後ろを見ると、みんなが戻っていた——呆然とし混乱しているかもしれないが——でも…生きていてそこにいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2231
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_8c5e33ae:

    # "A blonde girl turned to face me as I entered. Stood stoically behind her, an elderly mage watched."
    "私が入ると、金髪の少女が振り返って私を見た。彼女の背後にストイックに立って、年老いた魔導士が見守っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2232
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_6a42290d:

    # VIRGO "Ah, good, you made it through."
    VIRGO "ああ、よかった、辿り着いたな。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2233
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_0ba9a927:

    # SERAFINA @ shock "You..."
    SERAFINA @ shock "あなたは…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2234
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_c9936f06:

    # SERAFINA @ shock "You're the one from my dreams!"
    SERAFINA @ shock "夢に出てきた人だ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2235
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_bde6c2b6:

    # MC @ think "What?"
    MC @ think "何だ？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2236
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_d04f2520:

    # VIRGO "Where is Davik? Did he send for you?"
    VIRGO "ダヴィクはどこだ？彼が君たちを呼んだのか？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2237
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_ab371a2b:

    # MC @ talk "No, we were sent here by the girl's mothers."
    MC @ talk "いいえ、私たちは娘の母親たちに派遣された。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2238
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_089a5c83:

    # "I raised a brow at the youthful face in front of me."
    "目の前の若々しい顔に眉を上げた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2239
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_f858472b:

    # MC @ think "You're Serafina, I take it?"
    MC @ think "君がセラフィナだな？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2240
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_bc9fad83:

    # "The girl nodded."
    "少女はうなずいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2241
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_92966b94:

    # SERAFINA @ sad "Where is father?"
    SERAFINA @ sad "父はどこ？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2242
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_94af89f6:

    # SERAFINA @ sad "He went back through the house to gather supplies."
    SERAFINA @ sad "彼は物資を集めるために家の中を戻っていった。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2243
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_4a3076d3:

    # SERAFINA @ scared "We need him back before {i}it{/i} comes!"
    SERAFINA @ scared "{i}それ{/i}が来る前に彼に戻ってきてもらわないと！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2244
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_cbeb8405:

    # MC @ think "{i}It?{/i}"
    MC @ think "{i}それ？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2245
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_ce9d8fbd:

    # VIRGO "This house was designed for containment."
    VIRGO "この家は封じ込めのために設計された。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2246
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_e39f9a4f:

    # VIRGO "A place to store and contain her nightmares..."
    VIRGO "彼女の悪夢を保管し封じ込める場所…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2247
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_b5e226e9:

    # VIRGO "And hopefully, to gain mastery of her powers."
    VIRGO "そして願わくば、彼女の力の習熟を得るために。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2248
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_00884ec5:

    # SYPHA @ talk "You still haven't answered what {i}it{/i} is."
    SYPHA @ talk "まだ{i}それ{/i}が何か答えてない。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2249
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_31ab88d3:

    # "Around us, the world seems to bend and crackle, as {i}something{/i} fights its way through."
    "私たちの周りで、世界が曲がりパチパチと音を立て、{i}何か{/i}が通り抜けようと戦っている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2250
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_fc91cc92:

    # "Serafina's eyes glow purple, bleeding tears streaming down her face as she clutches her head, teeth gritted in pain."
    "セラフィナの目が紫色に輝き、血の涙が顔を伝い、頭を抱えて苦痛に歯を食いしばる。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2251
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_91568ef1:

    # VIRGO "The heart of her fears—it has manifested itself as this creature."
    VIRGO "彼女の恐怖の核心——それがこのクリーチャーとして具現化したのだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2253
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_5e22b05c:

    # VIRGO "And it refuses to stay a prisoner here."
    VIRGO "そしてそれはここに囚人として留まることを拒んでいる。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2254
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_7e1a7dc2:

    # "The sky ripples and tears as the creature begins to force its way into this reality."
    "クリーチャーがこの現実に無理やり侵入し始めると、空が波打ち引き裂かれる。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2255
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_d233aee6:

    # MC @ serious "What do we do?"
    MC @ serious "どうすればいい？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2256
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_1b4a865c:

    # "With a tap of his staff, I felt a surge of energy rush through me!"
    "彼の杖の一突きで、私の中を駆け抜けるエネルギーの高まりを感じた！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2259
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_c3bcd573:

    # VIRGO "Damn it... It seems we can wait no longer for your father, Serafina."
    VIRGO "くそ…どうやら君の父親をこれ以上待てないようだ、セラフィナ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2260
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_400ef679:

    # "The dark mage motioned to all of us."
    "闇の魔導士は私たち全員に合図した。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2261
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_969edbea:

    # VIRGO "You hold the creature back!"
    VIRGO "君たちはクリーチャーを食い止めろ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2262
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_997a7bc7:

    # VIRGO "{i}I'll seal the rift...{/i}"
    VIRGO "{i}私が裂け目を封じる…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2263
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_452972d0:

    # MARKUS @ scared "That's..."
    MARKUS @ scared "あれは…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2264
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_660c9d06:

    # MARKUS @ scared "{i}big.{/i}"
    MARKUS @ scared "{i}でかい。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2265
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_cfccf33a:

    # "Kiara and Sypha readied themselves."
    "キアラとサイファは身構えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2266
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_8cf086f6:

    # SYPHA @ angry "The power radiating from that thing... This won't be easy!"
    SYPHA @ angry "あのものから放射される力…これは簡単じゃない！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2268
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_a81fe26e:

    # "Ves tightened her hands around her axe."
    "ヴェスは斧を握る手を強めた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2269
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_998e5eb8:

    # VES @ angry "Let it come!"
    VES @ angry "来るがいい！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2270
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_3814d0d1:

    # "The sky ripped open, revealing a black void behind it."
    "空が引き裂かれ、その後ろに黒い虚空が現れた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2271
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_3ce9111e:

    # "Two great, pale hands reached through as the creature's head pushed through the darkness,"
    "クリーチャーの頭が闇を押し通り、二つの大きな青白い手が伸びてきて、"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2272
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_43dd8aa1:

    # "scowling at us as it opened its mouth to roar!"
    "口を開けて咆哮しながら私たちを睨みつけた！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2275
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_6d447bc0:

    # MC @ surprised "Here we go!"
    MC @ surprised "行くぞ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2276
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_786f0070:

    # MC @ angry "ALL AT ONCE!"
    MC @ angry "一斉に！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2285
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_cd8088ca:

    # VIRGO "NOW!"
    VIRGO "今だ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2286
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_d1be9a81:

    # "The nightmare creature retreated, pushed back into the darkness from which it tore through."
    "悪夢のクリーチャーは退却し、そこから引き裂いて出てきた闇の中へと押し戻された。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2287
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_d9e970d3:

    # "With trembling hands, his body pushed to its absolute limits, the veins in his arms and temples seeming ready to burst at any moment,"
    "震える手で、体を限界まで押し込み、腕とこめかみの血管がいつ破裂してもおかしくないように見える中、"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2288
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_c9ab07b2:

    # "the great tear was slowly sealed shut, until at last, it was gone."
    "大きな裂け目はゆっくりと封じられ、ついには消え去った。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2289
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_9d720c32:

    # "Dropping to his knees breathlessly, he looked up towards us."
    "息を切らして膝をつき、彼は私たちを見上げた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2290
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_c1696d9b:

    # VIRGO "Thank you... Your assistance was..."
    VIRGO "感謝する…君たちの助力は…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2291
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_86502b92:

    # VIRGO "welcomed."
    VIRGO "歓迎された。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2292
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_8599621e:

    # "No sooner had he finished than Davik appeared through the doorway."
    "彼が言い終わるや否や、ダヴィクが出入り口に現れた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2293
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_fa694f5d:

    # DAVIK "Serafina! SERAFINA!"
    DAVIK "セラフィナ！セラフィナ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2294
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_ba447962:

    # SERAFINA @ shock "Father!"
    SERAFINA @ shock "お父さん！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2295
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_af99b283:

    # DAVIK "Are you alright, girl?"
    DAVIK "大丈夫か、娘よ？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2296
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_1e866a89:

    # DAVIK "What happened?"
    DAVIK "何があった？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2297
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_8b371310:

    # SERAFINA @ smile "It's alright... Father."
    SERAFINA @ smile "大丈夫だよ…お父さん。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2298
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_b6d8e9f9:

    # SERAFINA @ smile "We did it, we sealed it away!"
    SERAFINA @ smile "やったの、封じ込めたんだ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2299
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_6c3e818e:

    # DAVIK "Thank the gods..."
    DAVIK "神々に感謝を…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2300
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_33c95ccd:

    # DAVIK "You have my eternal thanks for helping save my daughter."
    DAVIK "娘を救う手助けをしてくれたことに、永遠の感謝を。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2302
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_c7d70e1d:

    # DAVIK "Come, Serafina, let's go..."
    DAVIK "来なさい、セラフィナ、行こう…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2303
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_e9b40ebe:

    # MC @ think "Wait, hold for a moment."
    MC @ think "待て、ちょっと待ってくれ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2304
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_3f368aa9:

    # MC @ talk "I've been ordered to bring Serafina back to her mother."
    MC @ talk "セラフィナを母親のところに連れ戻すよう命令されている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2305
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_3553ec16:

    # DAVIK "You must think me a fool to just hand her back over!"
    DAVIK "ただ彼女を渡せと？私を愚か者だと思っているのか！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2306
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_33a83dce:

    # DAVIK "Not after all these years!"
    DAVIK "何年も経った後に！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2307
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_f6b52ec0:

    # VIRGO "WAIT!"
    VIRGO "待て！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2308
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_7d375837:

    # VIRGO "Both of you..."
    VIRGO "二人とも…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2309
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_2e1f113b:

    # "Slowly, the dark mage rose back to his feet."
    "ゆっくりと、闇の魔導士は立ち上がった。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2310
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_e74cc5a9:

    # VIRGO "Bring the girl back to her mothers, or let me take the girl as an apprentice."
    VIRGO "娘を母親の元に戻すか、私が娘を弟子として引き取るかだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2311
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_56420d6a:

    # DAVIK "ARE YOU INSANE?"
    DAVIK "気が狂ったのか？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2312
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_28cb88a0:

    # DAVIK "Your vile services were hired just to help me protect MY daughter!"
    DAVIK "お前の卑劣なサービスは、私の娘を守る手助けのためだけに雇われたんだ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2313
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_d926361c:

    # DAVIK "I'm an inquisitor! You really think I'm going to let a fucking dark mage tutor her?"
    DAVIK "私は審問官だ！クソ闇の魔導士に彼女を指導させると思うのか？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2314
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_f101a247:

    # DAVIK "No! She will come back with me to Novaras. There, she will learn under the Inquisition."
    DAVIK "違う！彼女は私と一緒にノヴァラスに戻る。そこで審問庁の下で学ぶんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2315
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_442d1d68:

    # VIRGO "Don't be a fool!"
    VIRGO "愚か者になるな！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2316
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_bcb28e67:

    # VIRGO "The Inquisition will only leash her!"
    VIRGO "審問庁は彼女を鎖で縛るだけだ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2317
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_56e4b672:

    # VIRGO "Her power is too valuable! With my help, she could learn to master it and turn the tide of this war!"
    VIRGO "彼女の力はあまりにも貴重だ！私の助けがあれば、彼女はそれを習熟し、この戦争の流れを変えることができる！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2318
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_f231572e:

    # SERAFINA @ shock "S-STOP FIGHTING!"
    SERAFINA @ shock "け、喧嘩やめて！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2319
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_2c9605f9:

    # SERAFINA @ sad "... You."
    SERAFINA @ sad "…あなた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2320
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_3f9d9321:

    # "Serafina's gaze turns towards me."
    "セラフィナの視線が私に向く。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2321
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_3c96fcdf:

    # SERAFINA @ sad "What do you think I should do?"
    SERAFINA @ sad "私がどうすべきだと思う？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2322
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_53426c3f:

    # DAVIK "You can't seriously be—"
    DAVIK "まさか本気で——"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2323
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_417f4d9c:

    # SERAFINA @ talk "I saw him... {i}father.{/i}"
    SERAFINA @ talk "彼を見たの…{i}お父さん。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2324
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_580bfb09:

    # SERAFINA @ talk "In my dreams."
    SERAFINA @ talk "夢の中で。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2325
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_5241ae73:

    # SERAFINA @ talk "I think he's the one to tell me which way to go!"
    SERAFINA @ talk "彼がどの道を行くべきか教えてくれる人だと思う！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2326
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_58544e5d:

    # VIRGO "... Interesting."
    VIRGO "…興味深い。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2327
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_d5521272:

    # SERAFINA @ talk "So then... What do you think I should do?"
    SERAFINA @ talk "じゃあ…私がどうすべきだと思う？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2332
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_2deb28e8:

    # SERAFINA @ talk "Father, I'll come with you."
    SERAFINA @ talk "お父さん、一緒に行くよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2334
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_91c9e242:

    # VIRGO "Damn fools."
    VIRGO "くそ愚か者ども。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2335
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_a3cb29c2:

    # VIRGO "You're wasting your potential with the Inquisition!"
    VIRGO "審問庁で自分の可能性を無駄にしてるんだ！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2336
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_bd12dc3f:

    # VIRGO "They'll show you the ceiling, but never show you how to break through it!"
    VIRGO "彼らは天井を見せてくれるが、それを突破する方法は決して教えてくれない！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2337
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_341ba180:

    # DAVIK "And that's fine with me!"
    DAVIK "それで構わない！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2338
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_4c9801a7:

    # DAVIK "She's my daughter, not a damn weapon!"
    DAVIK "彼女は私の娘だ、クソ武器じゃない！"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2339
translate ja qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_c53b35fd:

    # VIRGO "No... Now she's going to become something worse."
    VIRGO "違う…今や彼女はもっと悪いものになるだろう。"

